<title>FRANCE: Synthelabo Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Synthelabo Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales			 2,856	   vs	  2,617</p>
<p>NOTE - The group, which released the figures in the BALO official bulletin, said sales rose 9.2 percent versus the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>On a like-for-like basis the 1996 comparison figure would be 2,725 million, which would mean a 4.5 percent rise in 1997 first quarter sales, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
